WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.756 --> 00:00:14.728
&gt;&gt; Time is the great equalizer

00:00:14.995 --> 00:00:16.363
in hospitals all across Turkey.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:18.131
There is not enough of it here

00:00:18.532 --> 00:00:20.634
in adana at the teaching and

00:00:20.901 --> 00:00:21.768
research hospital.

00:00:21.802 --> 00:00:24.438
&gt;&gt; The patients come in with

00:00:24.704 --> 00:00:26.206
fractures, what sort of

00:00:26.573 --> 00:00:27.073
injuries?

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:34.147
The patients consist of tissue

00:00:34.548 --> 00:00:36.416
lost, brain trauma.

00:00:36.683 --> 00:00:39.786
&gt;&gt; This doctor's chief of staff

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:40.520
here.

00:00:40.687 --> 00:00:42.522
Within minutes, his trauma team

00:00:42.789 --> 00:00:43.790
is paged again.

00:00:44.191 --> 00:00:46.359
Another helicopter is arriving.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.495
We are now walking with the

00:00:48.762 --> 00:00:49.796
chief of staff of the hospital

00:00:49.796 --> 00:00:50.630
to the helipad.

00:00:51.231 --> 00:00:53.133
He tells me they've had some

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:54.534
5000 patients who have come

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:56.403
here over the last several days.

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:58.405
The orthopedic surgeons, the

00:00:58.672 --> 00:00:59.806
neuro surgeons have been

00:00:59.806 --> 00:01:00.540
operating for seven days

00:01:00.807 --> 00:01:02.409
straight, basically.

00:01:02.676 --> 00:01:04.144
This is the largest trauma

00:01:04.544 --> 00:01:07.414
hospital in the quake zone.

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:08.682
&gt;&gt; The doctors move fast.

00:01:09.149 --> 00:01:12.185
The goal is to care for this

00:01:12.586 --> 00:01:13.353
26-year-old woman.

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:16.122
Her kidneys are failing from

00:01:16.556 --> 00:01:18.558
something a known as crush

00:01:18.825 --> 00:01:19.325
syndrome.

00:01:21.928 --> 00:01:27.000
She will need kidney dialysis.

00:01:28.902 --> 00:01:29.836
Patients from the quake zone

00:01:30.203 --> 00:01:33.840
finally, thankfully making it

00:01:34.174 --> 00:01:34.674
here for help.

00:01:34.808 --> 00:01:36.276
With the most remarkable story

00:01:36.543 --> 00:01:37.844
I have heard, this beautiful

00:01:38.245 --> 00:01:39.846
family of five felt the Earth

00:01:40.213 --> 00:01:41.381
shake and then watched the

00:01:41.848 --> 00:01:42.348
unthinkable happened.

00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:47.387
&gt;&gt; Translator: The block of

00:01:47.854 --> 00:01:48.622
flatter seven stories high.

00:01:48.889 --> 00:01:49.890
&gt;&gt; They could do nothing but

00:01:50.156 --> 00:01:51.858
watch as an eight month old

00:01:51.858 --> 00:01:52.859
baby was somehow hurdled from

00:01:53.126 --> 00:01:55.328
the window, five stories to the

00:01:55.862 --> 00:01:56.862
ground.

00:01:57.330 --> 00:01:58.632
Look what happened to their

00:01:58.899 --> 00:02:01.501
building, just flattened.

00:02:02.369 --> 00:02:04.304
Somehow, she survived after

00:02:04.671 --> 00:02:05.872
being trapped herself for

00:02:05.972 --> 00:02:06.640
almost 14 hours.

00:02:07.407 --> 00:02:09.276
She began to dig and scrape

00:02:09.876 --> 00:02:11.478
through the rubble for any sign,

00:02:11.878 --> 00:02:13.480
any sign at all that her baby

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:14.380
girl was still alive.

00:02:14.381 --> 00:02:18.318
&gt;&gt; Translator: At that point,

00:02:18.585 --> 00:02:19.486
the fifth day, we thought we

00:02:19.886 --> 00:02:20.420
would be seeing her lifeless

00:02:20.687 --> 00:02:21.054
body.

00:02:21.054 --> 00:02:27.060
&gt;&gt; Something astonishing up

00:02:27.327 --> 00:02:27.827
and.

00:02:27.894 --> 00:02:28.962
Someone showed them this post

00:02:29.229 --> 00:02:30.764
on Twitter.

00:02:31.031 --> 00:02:32.799
At first, they were not sure,

00:02:33.066 --> 00:02:34.801
but this baby girl looked very

00:02:35.068 --> 00:02:35.568
much like her daughter.

00:02:35.902 --> 00:02:40.173
&gt;&gt; Translator: You see, we had

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:42.142
no idea she had been saved.

00:02:42.409 --> 00:02:43.944
&gt;&gt; In the chaos, a good

00:02:44.311 --> 00:02:45.178
samaritan had rescued the girl

00:02:45.445 --> 00:02:47.314
and she was flown here, broken

